// Glaive Turbo body: a late-90s all-wheel-drive turbo rally sedan for the street.
//
// Intent: a plain, upright compact four-door made fierce. A blunt nose with slim lamps
// and a slot over a big lower intake, a scoop on the hood feeding the intercooler, a tall
// square cabin, a short deck under a tall wing on uprights, mud flaps behind every wheel,
// five-spoke alloys. Front engine, all four wheels driven. Generic period cues only.
//
// Units are meters; x runs rearward from the nose, y up from the ground. Layout:
// docs/VEHICLES.md and crates/vehicle/src/shape/params.rs.
ShapeSpec(
    id: "glaive_turbo",
    side: [
        (0.00, 0.52), (0.04, 0.62), (0.15, 0.72), (1.20, 0.92), (1.28, 0.94),
        (1.80, 1.38), (1.92, 1.43), (2.95, 1.42), (3.50, 1.08), (3.60, 1.06),
        (4.30, 1.04), (4.40, 0.96),
        (4.40, 0.34), (4.26, 0.24), (3.80, 0.18), (0.70, 0.17), (0.14, 0.21), (0.00, 0.32),
    ],
    plan: [
        (0.00, 0.70), (0.08, 0.80), (0.30, 0.855), (1.00, 0.865), (3.90, 0.865), (4.25, 0.85),
        (4.40, 0.80),
    ],
    belt: [(1.28, 0.93), (2.40, 0.97), (3.55, 1.04)],
